    "Calendar": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Calendar"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "कैलेंडर"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "캘린더"
          }
        },
        "mi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maramataka"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "日历"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Calendar access is optional. Events added to a calendar may sync through that calendar's provider. Exported calendar files are separate copies and do not update automatically.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Calendar access is optional. Events added to a calendar may sync through that calendar's provider. Exported calendar files are separate copies and do not update automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "日历访问权限是可选的。添加的事件可能通过日历服务商同步。导出的日历文件是独立副本，不会自动更新。"
          }
        },
        "mi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kei a koe te kōwhiringa mō te urunga ki te maramataka. Ka tukutahitia pea ngā takahanga kua tāpirihia mā tō kaiwhakarato maramataka. He tārua motuhake ngā kōnae maramataka kua kaweake, ā, kāore e whakahou aunoa."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "캘린더 접근 권한은 선택 사항입니다. 추가한 일정은 캘린더 제공업체를 통해 동기화될 수 있습니다. 내보낸 캘린더 파일은 별도 사본이며 자동으로 업데이트되지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "कैलेंडर की अनुमति वैकल्पिक है। जोड़े गए इवेंट कैलेंडर प्रदाता के माध्यम से सिंक हो सकते हैं। निर्यात की गई कैलेंडर फ़ाइलें अलग प्रतियाँ हैं और अपने आप अपडेट नहीं होतीं।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Calendar access was denied. Please enable it in Settings.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "कैलेंडर एक्सेस अस्वीकार किया गया। कृपया सेटिंग्स में सक्षम करें।"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "캘린더 접근이 거부되었습니다. 설정에서 활성화해 주세요."
          }
        },
        "mi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kua whakakorehia te āhei ki te Maramataka. Whakakāhia ki ngā Tautuhinga."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "日历访问被拒绝，请在设置中启用。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Calendar access was denied. Please enable it in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Calendar events could not be removed": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Calendar events could not be removed"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法删除日历事件"
          }
        },
        "mi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kāore i taea te tango ngā takahanga maramataka"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "캘린더 일정을 삭제하지 못했습니다"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "कैलेंडर इवेंट हटाए नहीं जा सके"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Calendar events could not be updated. Please try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Calendar events could not be updated. Please try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法更新日历事件，请重试。"
          }
        },
        "mi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kāore i taea te whakahou ngā takahanga maramataka. Whakamātauria anō."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "캘린더 일정을 업데이트할 수 없습니다. 다시 시도하세요."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "कैलेंडर इवेंट अपडेट नहीं किए जा सके। कृपया फिर कोशिश करें।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Calendar events from earlier app versions cannot be identified safely by this version. Review and remove any old Bin Day events yourself in Calendar if they are no longer correct.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Calendar events from earlier app versions cannot be identified safely by this version. Review and remove any old Bin Day events yourself in Calendar if they are no longer correct."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此版本无法安全识别旧版应用创建的日历事件。请在日历中自行检查旧的 Bin Day 事件，如果日期已不正确，请将其删除。"
          }
        },
        "mi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kāore tēnei putanga e āhei ki te tautuhi haumaru i ngā takahanga maramataka nō ngā putanga o mua. Arotakengia ngā takahanga Bin Day tawhito i Maramataka, ā, ki te kore e tika ana, māu tonu e tango."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 버전에서는 이전 앱 버전에서 만든 캘린더 일정을 안전하게 식별할 수 없습니다. 캘린더에서 기존 Bin Day 일정을 직접 확인하고 더 이상 정확하지 않은 일정은 삭제하세요."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "यह संस्करण ऐप के पुराने संस्करणों द्वारा बनाए गए कैलेंडर इवेंट को सुरक्षित रूप से पहचान नहीं सकता। कैलेंडर में पुराने Bin Day इवेंट स्वयं जाँचें और यदि वे अब सही नहीं हैं तो उन्हें हटा दें।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
