    "Collection events repeat without reopening Bin Day NZ. One-off changes update when you save your schedule. Calendar reminder events add alerts at both chosen times. To avoid duplicate alerts, turn off app notifications if you use calendar alerts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Collection events repeat without reopening Bin Day NZ. One-off changes update when you save your schedule. Calendar reminder events add alerts at both chosen times. To avoid duplicate alerts, turn off app notifications if you use calendar alerts."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "收集事件会重复，无需重新打开 Bin Day NZ。保存安排时，单次变更会更新。日历提醒会在所选的两个时间发出提示。如使用日历提醒，请关闭应用通知以避免重复。"
          }
        },
        "mi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ka tāruarua ngā takahanga kohinga me te kore e huaki anō i a Bin Day NZ. Ka whakahoungia ngā panonitanga kotahi ina tiakina tō hōtaka. Ka tāpiri ngā takahanga whakamahara maramataka i ngā matohi i ngā wā e rua i kōwhiria. Ki te whakamahi matohi maramataka, whakawetohia ngā whakamōhiotanga taupānga kia kore ai e tāruarua."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "수거 일정은 Bin Day NZ를 다시 열지 않아도 반복됩니다. 일회성 변경은 일정을 저장할 때 반영됩니다. 캘린더 알림은 선택한 두 시간에 모두 설정됩니다. 중복 알림을 피하려면 캘린더 알림 사용 시 앱 알림을 끄세요."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bin Day NZ दोबारा खोले बिना संग्रह इवेंट दोहराते रहते हैं। कार्यक्रम सहेजने पर एकबारगी बदलाव अपडेट होते हैं। कैलेंडर अनुस्मारक दोनों चुने हुए समयों पर अलर्ट जोड़ते हैं। दोहरे अलर्ट से बचने के लिए कैलेंडर अलर्ट इस्तेमाल करते समय ऐप की सूचनाएँ बंद करें।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Collection terms and limits": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Collection terms and limits"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "收集条款和限制"
          }
        },
        "mi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ngā tikanga me ngā here kohinga"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "수거 조건 및 제한"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "संग्रह की शर्तें और सीमाएँ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Collections up to that day get no reminders. Your schedule, widget and calendar are unchanged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Collections up to that day get no reminders. Your schedule, widget and calendar are unchanged."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "截至该日的收集不会发送提醒。您的收集安排、小组件和日历保持不变。"
          }
        },
        "mi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kāore he whakamaumahara mō ngā kohinga tae atu ki taua rā. Kāore e rerekē tō hōtaka, tō widget me tō maramataka."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "그날까지의 수거에는 알림이 오지 않습니다. 일정, 위젯, 캘린더는 그대로 유지됩니다."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "उस दिन तक के संग्रह के लिए कोई रिमाइंडर नहीं मिलेगा। आपका कार्यक्रम, विजेट और कैलेंडर वैसे ही रहेंगे।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Concrete, tiles and plasterboard": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Concrete, tiles and plasterboard"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
