    "Council links open the official website in your browser. The app does not upload your saved address to your council.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Council links open the official website in your browser. The app does not upload your saved address to your council."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "议会链接会在浏览器中打开官方网站。本应用不会将您保存的地址上传给您的议会。"
          }
        },
        "mi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ka huaki ngā hononga kaunihera i te paetukutuku mana i tō pūtirotiro. Kāore te taupānga e tuku i tō wāhitau kua tiakina ki tō kaunihera."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "의회 링크는 브라우저에서 공식 웹사이트를 엽니다. 앱은 저장된 주소를 의회에 업로드하지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "काउंसिल लिंक आपके ब्राउज़र में आधिकारिक वेबसाइट खोलते हैं। ऐप आपका सहेजा गया पता आपकी काउंसिल को अपलोड नहीं करता।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
