    "Holiday changes are applied automatically only where the council publishes one clear rule. Elsewhere the app shows the affected dates and links the council notice.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Holiday changes are applied automatically only where the council publishes one clear rule. Elsewhere the app shows the affected dates and links the council notice."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有当议会公布了一条明确规则时，假期变动才会自动应用。其他地区，应用会显示受影响的日期并链接议会通知。"
          }
        },
        "mi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ka whakaurua aunoa ngā panonitanga hararei i ngā wāhi anake e whakaputa ana te kaunihera i tētahi ture mārama kotahi. I ētahi atu wāhi, ka whakaatu te taupānga i ngā rā e pāngia ana, ka hono hoki ki te pānui a te kaunihera."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "휴일 변경은 의회가 명확한 규칙 하나를 공개한 경우에만 자동으로 적용됩니다. 그 외 지역에서는 영향을 받는 날짜를 표시하고 의회 안내로 연결합니다."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "अवकाश परिवर्तन केवल वहीं स्वतः लागू होते हैं जहाँ काउंसिल एक स्पष्ट नियम प्रकाशित करती है। अन्य जगहों पर ऐप प्रभावित तारीखें दिखाता है और काउंसिल सूचना का लिंक देता है।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hot ashes": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hot ashes"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "热灰烬"
          }
        },
        "mi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "He pungarehu wera"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "뜨거운 재"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "गरम राख"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If playback is unavailable here, open YouTube. Captions are controlled in the player and may not be available in your language.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If playback is unavailable here, open YouTube. Captions are controlled in the player and may not be available in your language."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果无法在此播放，请打开 YouTube。字幕可在播放器中控制，但不一定提供您的语言。"
          }
        },
        "mi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ki te kore e taea te purei i konei, huakina a YouTube. Ka whakahaerehia ngā kupu hauraro i te pūpāpāho, ā, kāore pea e wātea i tō reo."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "여기서 재생할 수 없으면 YouTube를 여세요. 자막은 플레이어에서 설정하며 원하는 언어가 제공되지 않을 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "यदि यहाँ वीडियो नहीं चल रहा है, तो YouTube खोलें। कैप्शन प्लेयर में नियंत्रित होते हैं और हो सकता है आपकी भाषा में उपलब्ध न हों।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In %d days": {
      "comment": "Small uppercase eyebrow on Today before the date, when the next collection is two or more days away: 'In 3 days · Friday 13 November'. %d is always 2 or more.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
