            "state": "translated",
            "value": "आपके डिब्बों का कार्यक्रम"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your next bin day, made clear": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your next bin day, made clear"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下一次收集日，一目了然"
          }
        },
        "mi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kia mārama tō rā kohinga para e whai ake nei"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "다음 수거일을 한눈에"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "अगला कचरा संग्रह दिन, अब स्पष्ट"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes your saved data and disconnects calendar sync. Existing calendar events may remain and continue alerting. Remove them in Calendar; Bin Day NZ will no longer track them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This removes your saved data and disconnects calendar sync. Existing calendar events may remain and continue alerting. Remove them in Calendar; Bin Day NZ will no longer track them."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这将删除您保存的数据并断开日历同步。现有日历事件可能会保留并继续提醒。请在日历中删除这些事件；Bin Day NZ 将不再追踪它们。"
          }
        },
        "mi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ka tangohia ō raraunga kua tiakina, ka momotuhia hoki te tukutahi maramataka. Ka noho pea ngā takahanga maramataka o nāianei, ka tuku matohi tonu. Tangohia aua takahanga i Maramataka; kāore a Bin Day NZ e aroturuki tonu i aua takahanga."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "저장된 데이터가 삭제되고 캘린더 동기화가 해제됩니다. 기존 캘린더 일정은 남아 알림을 계속 보낼 수 있습니다. 캘린더에서 직접 삭제해 주세요. Bin Day NZ는 더 이상 해당 일정을 관리하지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "इससे आपका सहेजा हुआ डेटा हट जाएगा और कैलेंडर सिंक बंद हो जाएगा। मौजूदा कैलेंडर इवेंट बने रह सकते हैं और अलर्ट देते रह सकते हैं। उन्हें कैलेंडर में हटाएँ; Bin Day NZ अब उनका रिकॉर्ड नहीं रखेगा।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your saved information could not be updated. Free some device storage and reopen Bin Day NZ. Existing data has not been reset.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your saved information could not be updated. Free some device storage and reopen Bin Day NZ. Existing data has not been reset."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法更新您保存的信息。请释放一些设备存储空间后重新打开 Bin Day NZ。现有数据尚未重置。"
          }
        },
        "mi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kāore i taea te whakahou ō mōhiohio kua tiakina. Whakawāteatia ētahi wāhi rokiroki, ka huaki anō i a Bin Day NZ. Kāore ngā raraunga o mua i tautuhi anō."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "저장된 정보를 업데이트할 수 없습니다. 기기 저장 공간을 확보한 뒤 Bin Day NZ를 다시 여세요. 기존 데이터는 초기화되지 않았습니다."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "आपकी सहेजी हुई जानकारी अपडेट नहीं हो सकी। डिवाइस में कुछ जगह खाली करके Bin Day NZ फिर खोलें। मौजूदा डेटा रीसेट नहीं किया गया है।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your schedule": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your schedule"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "您的收集安排"
          }
        },
        "mi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tō hōtaka kohinga"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "내 일정"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "आपका कार्यक्रम"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your schedule could not be saved. Please try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your schedule could not be saved. Please try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法保存您的收集安排，请重试。"
          }
        },
        "mi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kāore i taea te tiaki tō hōtaka kohinga. Whakamātauria anō."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "수거 일정을 저장하지 못했습니다. 다시 시도하세요."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "आपका कार्यक्रम सहेजा नहीं जा सका। कृपया फिर कोशिश करें।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your schedule saved, but the widget could not update. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your schedule saved, but the widget could not update. Try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "收集安排已保存，但小组件未能更新。请重试。"
          }
        },
        "mi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kua tiakina tō hōtaka, engari kāore i taea te whakahou te widgiti. Whakamātauria anō."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "일정은 저장되었지만 위젯을 업데이트하지 못했습니다. 다시 시도하세요."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "आपका कार्यक्रम सहेज लिया गया, लेकिन विजेट अपडेट नहीं हो सका। फिर कोशिश करें।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your schedule saved. Calendar needs attention: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your schedule saved. Calendar needs attention: %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "收集安排已保存。日历需要处理：%@"
          }
        },
        "mi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kua tiakina tō hōtaka. Me tirotiro te maramataka: %@"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "일정이 저장되었습니다. 캘린더 확인 필요: %@"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "आपका कार्यक्रम सहेज लिया गया। कैलेंडर पर ध्यान दें: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your schedule saved. Reminders need attention: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your schedule saved. Reminders need attention: %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
